{
  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing the RNA encoder from pca_n2000 to scvi_n200 in a multimodal multiprofile setup with resnet50, avgpool, and weighted fusion, building on the high-performing config_019. Validation accuracy improved to 0.6776, suggesting the RNA encoder choice may influence performance. However, the exact contribution of this change versus other variables remains uncertain without further isolation."
}

